{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301720","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301720","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130172001:1":{"text":"이케브뿐만 아니라 다른 어린 트라이브도 몇 명 같이 사라졌어요.","source_cn":"不止是他，还有聚落的其他几个小蛮血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B73E10ABCF25627","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130172002:1":{"text":"사람들 이야기를 들어보니 상단을 따라간 것 같다고 하더라고요.","source_cn":"听其他人说，他们好像跟着一个商队离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89EEADFF5B834ACA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130172003:1":{"text":"그런데 아직까지 집에 오지 않고 있어요. 나간 지 오래되었는데...","source_cn":"可都过了这么久，还是不见他们回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x438C32214BCD2BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血洛娃":{"text":"로바","source":"小蛮血洛娃","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}